# Build contexts are the repository root (see infra/docker-compose.yml). Host build outputs and
# VCS state must never enter an image: each Dockerfile installs dependencies inside the build, so
# copying node_modules, target/, or .git/ only bloats and slows the context.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/cache
**/artifacts
**/typechain-types
# Secrets outlive the layer that carried them: with a root build context, anything not excluded
# here is baked into an image once a future Dockerfile grows a broad COPY.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
node/data/
infra/shardstore-data/
